    "body": "The red step is `app suites: first_part_programs` (`first_router_part_posts_the_shipped_program`), from commit 995337a66 (PR #3464) on. It is the one red step in the runs of 995337a66 (1122 steps) and c5bb09ed1 (1124 steps). The cause is known and is on #3572: the shipped `examples/first-router-part.nc` has one stale line (a second `T2 M6` for a section that keeps its tool). The posted program is correct. The fix is to make that example again. This issue closes itself on the first green run after that fix.",
